<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>apt.lucapadovan.dev</title>
<meta name="description" content="Signed APT repository for Debian and Ubuntu with packages by Luca Padovan.">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0c111d;
    --bg-raised: #121a2b;
    --bg-code: #0f1626;
    --text: #e4e9f2;
    --muted: #9aa5ba;
    --faint: #6b7790;
    --line: #232d42;
    --accent: #4cc2ff;
    --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", system-ui, Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    --mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "Cascadia Code", "JetBrains Mono", Menlo, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
    :root {
      --bg: #ffffff;
      --bg-raised: #f5f7fa;
      --bg-code: #f3f5f8;
      --text: #141b2a;
      --muted: #536077;
      --faint: #7a8599;
      --line: #e1e6ee;
      --accent: #0a6db4;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font: 16px/1.6 var(--sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }
  main { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 24px 48px; }

  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 7vw, 2rem); overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 650; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 650; margin: 0; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 56px; max-width: 60ch; }
  section { margin-bottom: 56px; }
  section > p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 20px; }

  code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.88em; }
  .code { position: relative; }
  pre {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg-code);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .code pre { padding-right: 84px; }
  .copy {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    right: 10px;
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font: 500 0.8rem var(--sans);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .copy:hover { color: var(--text); }

  .packages { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .packages li { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 22px; background: var(--bg-raised); }
  .pkg-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .pkg-head a { color: var(--text); }
  .version { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .packages p { color: var(--muted); margin: 6px 0 16px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .pkg-foot { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px 16px; }
  .pkg-foot code { background: var(--bg-code); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 10px; }
  .archs { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.85rem; }

  dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 8px 20px; margin: 0; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  dt { color: var(--faint); }
  dd { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 24px; color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  footer a { color: var(--muted); }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    main { padding: 48px 16px 40px; }
    dl { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px; }
    dd { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>apt.lucapadovan.dev</h1>
  <p class="lede">A signed APT repository for Debian, Ubuntu and their derivatives. Packages are rebuilt from each project's GitHub releases, so updates arrive with <code>apt upgrade</code>.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Set up the repository</h2>
    <p>Run once. It adds the signing key and a source that trusts only that key.</p>
    <div class="code">
      <pre id="setup">sudo install -d -m 0755 /etc/apt/keyrings
curl -fsSL https://apt.lucapadovan.dev/lucapadovan.gpg | sudo tee /etc/apt/keyrings/lucapadovan.gpg &gt;/dev/null
echo "deb [signed-by=/etc/apt/keyrings/lucapadovan.gpg] https://apt.lucapadovan.dev stable main" \
  | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/lucapadovan.list
sudo apt update</pre>
      <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="setup" hidden>Copy</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Packages</h2>
    <p>Then install any of these with <code>apt</code>.</p>
    <ul class="packages">
$packages
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Details</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt>Suite</dt><dd><code>stable</code>, component <code>main</code></dd>
      <dt>Signing key</dt><dd><code>$fingerprint</code> (<a href="lucapadovan.asc">ASCII</a>, <a href="lucapadovan.gpg">binary</a>)</dd>
      <dt>Source</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/padovanl/packages">github.com/padovanl/packages</a></dd>
      <dt>Removal</dt><dd><code>sudo rm /etc/apt/sources.list.d/lucapadovan.list /etc/apt/keyrings/lucapadovan.gpg</code></dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <footer>Maintained by <a href="https://lucapadovan.dev">Luca Padovan</a>.</footer>
</main>
<script>
  if (navigator.clipboard) {
    document.querySelectorAll('.copy').forEach(function (button) {
      button.hidden = false;
      button.addEventListener('click', function () {
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById(button.dataset.copy).textContent).then(function () {
          button.textContent = 'Copied';
          setTimeout(function () { button.textContent = 'Copy'; }, 1500);
        });
      });
    });
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
